@startuml 04-activity-ci-pipeline
title CI/CD Pipeline Flow (.github/workflows/ci.yml)

start
:Trigger: pull request to main, push to main, or manual run;
fork

:1. Checkout + set up JDK 21 (Maven cache);
:2. Render PlantUML diagrams to SVG;
if (Diagram syntax error?) then (yes)
  :Fail build; <<#pink>>
  stop
endif
:3. Unit tests (mvn test);
if (Any unit test fails?) then (yes)
  :Fail build; <<#pink>>
  stop
endif
:4. Integration / regression tests\n(Testcontainers: Kafka, PostgreSQL, MongoDB);
if (Any integration test fails?) then (yes)
  :Fail build; <<#pink>>
  stop
endif
:5. JaCoCo coverage report + gate;
if (Line coverage < 80%?) then (yes)
  :Fail build; <<#pink>>
  stop
endif
:5b. Traceability matrix\n(every test tagged with a known acceptance criterion;\ndocs/traceability.md up to date);
if (Unknown/missing tag, failing tagged test\nor stale matrix?) then (yes)
  :Fail build; <<#pink>>
  stop
endif
:6a. Trivy dependency scan;
if (CRITICAL vulnerability?) then (yes)
  :Fail build; <<#pink>>
  stop
endif
:6b. Trivy full report (every severity, never fails; uploaded);
:8. Build Docker image (non-root);
:6c. Trivy image scan (OS + libraries);
if (CRITICAL vulnerability?) then (yes)
  :Fail build; <<#pink>>
  stop
endif
:Pipeline green; <<#palegreen>>
:9. Upload reports (tests, coverage, traceability, scans) and rendered SVGs\n(always, also on failure);
fork again
:compose-smoke job: scripts/compose-smoke.sh\n(docker compose up --build, readiness UP, store and read a trade);
if (Not ready or trade not stored?) then (yes)
  :Fail build; <<#pink>>
  stop
endif
end fork
note right
  Performance baseline (US-605): separate workflow,
  manual dispatch only; uploads target/performance/summary.md
end note
stop

@enduml
